{"type":"Film","id":"ES2017_038","slug":"es2017-038-la-mano-invisible","title":{"native":"La mano invisible","english":"The Invisible Hand"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-04-28","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"David Macián","slug":"david-macian","name":"David Macián","birthYear":1980,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama","Multi-protagonist film"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt4552700/mediaviewer/rm3668915712/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.filmaffinity.com/es/evideos.php?movie_id=852143"},"synopsis":{"native":"En una nave industrial, once personas son contratadas para hacer su trabajo frente a un público: un albañil, un carnicero, una costurera, una teleoperadora, un camarero, un mozo, un mecánico, un informático y una limpiadora. Obra de arte, reality show, experimento macabro: no saben ante lo que se hallan, ni quien es la mano que mueve los hilos en ese perverso teatrillo. Adaptación de la novela de Isaac Rosa, mordiente parábola sobre la precariedad laboral.","english":"An industrial warehouse is turned into a stage where a group of ordinary professionals are assembled daily to perform different tasks with apparent normality. Meanwhile, from the darkness of the auditorium, dozens of visitors observe the 'wonderful' work show."},"production":[{"country":"Spain","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"ES2017_038_01","film":"ES2017_038","person":{"id":"Luis Fernández de Eribe","slug":"luis-fernandez-de-eribe","name":"Luis Fernández de Eribe","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Unknown","origin":"White Western European","class":"Unknown","profession":"Unknown","ability":"Unknown","assistedMobility":"Unknown"},{"id":"ES2017_038_02","film":"ES2017_038","person":{"id":"Bruto Pomeroy","slug":"bruto